#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:20002
#: baf60ed9e1de4530ac0dae3f7880d804
msgid "Tutorial: Transfer Function Measurement"
msgstr "チュートリアル: 伝達関数の測定"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:20004
#: a995a55a59584ab59fa0853a97883dcb
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates how to use `gwexpy` to estimate the transfer "
"function of a system from measured data, fit a physical model to the "
"transfer function, and identify system parameters."
msgstr ""
"このチュートリアルでは、`gwexpy` を使用して測定データからシステムの伝達関数（Transfer Function）を推定し、 "
"物理モデルへのフィッティングを行ってパラメータを同定する流れを解説します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:20007
#: 8ed91ef17877468e8a715c2a72aa8925
msgid ""
"**Scenario:** We inject white noise into a mechanical vibration system "
"(or electrical circuit) and measure its response. From this input-output "
"data, we will determine the system's resonance frequency $f_0$ and "
"quality factor $Q$."
msgstr ""
"**シナリオ:** ある機械振動系（または電気回路）に白色雑音を入力し、その応答を測定しました。 この入出力データから、システムの共振周波数 "
"$f_0$ と Q値 $Q$ を求めます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:20011
#: 155786ab9232465e8445a6b81739e23d
msgid "**Workflow:**"
msgstr "**ワークフロー:**"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:20012
#: 84c45e5176464422a8efd5eb97454a5d
msgid ""
"**Data generation**: Simulate an input signal (white noise) and the "
"system output (resonant system response + measurement noise)."
msgstr "**データ生成**: 入力信号（白色雑音）と、それに対するシステムの出力（共振系応答 + 測定ノイズ）をシミュレーションします。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:20013
#: def0366363604b159e25511afc65be66
msgid ""
"**Transfer function estimation**: Calculate the transfer function and "
"coherence from the input-output time series data and plot the Bode plot."
msgstr "**伝達関数の推定**: 入出力の時系列データから伝達関数とコヒーレンスを計算し、ボード線図（Bode Plot）を描画します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:20014
#: b0514ba633074a9bb4961313eee6b977
msgid ""
"**Model fitting**: Fit a theoretical model (such as a Lorentzian "
"function) to the estimated transfer function to extract system "
"parameters."
msgstr "**モデルフィッティング**: 推定した伝達関数に理論モデル（ローレンツ関数など）を当てはめ、パラメータを推定します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40002
#: d5453c1535d54078a5c47d09e9691ab1
msgid "1. Generating Experimental Data (Simulation)"
msgstr "1\\. 実験データの生成（シミュレーション）"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40004
#: 9d8795d6a7334a11919d254954474bba
msgid "We will conduct a virtual experiment."
msgstr "仮想的な実験を行います。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40005
#: 62dc3a33b047405cb2f6981f34afe584
msgid "**System**: Second-order resonant system (harmonic oscillator)"
msgstr "**システム**: 2次共振系（単振動）"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40006
#: ee10e427880a42c0b16ffa166fbfe03c
msgid "Resonance frequency $f_0 = 300$ Hz"
msgstr "共振周波数 $f_0 = 300$ Hz"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40007
#: a0fd232926d146759e30fb998001fb6f
msgid "Quality factor $Q = 50$"
msgstr "Q値 $Q = 50$"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40008
#: 2189f9e3a74b41cb83b52d707f5fbc0e
msgid "**Input**: White noise"
msgstr "**入力**: 白色雑音（White Noise）"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40009
#: 07a4b5e31e204d1f825284bb15ad6510
msgid "**Measurement**: Sampling frequency 2048 Hz, duration 60 seconds"
msgstr "**測定**: サンプリング周波数 2048 Hz, 継続時間 60秒"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:40011
#: 2b23631389004b9083ed94777ed44393
msgid "The output signal will also include measurement noise."
msgstr "出力信号には、測定に伴うノイズも付加します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:60002
#: db600e63e66c42e981a1d73517d1a10b
msgid "2. Transfer Function Estimation"
msgstr "2\\. 伝達関数の推定"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:60004
#: cb8637da18fd483fbfa47590d4d7d3e4
msgid ""
"From the input-output time series data `ts_input` and `ts_output`, we "
"estimate the frequency response function (transfer function). We use the "
"`transfer_function` method of `gwexpy`."
msgstr ""
"入出力の時系列データ `ts_input` と `ts_output` から、周波数応答関数（伝達関数）を推定します。 `gwexpy` の "
"`transfer_function` メソッドを使用します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:60007
#: 73d173756cfa48f3a8196b67f1005300
msgid ""
"We also calculate the **magnitude-squared coherence** ($\\gamma^2$, see "
"[Physics Models: Coherence](../../explanation/physics_models.md)) to "
"assess the reliability of the measurement. Frequency bands where "
"$\\gamma^2$ is close to 1 indicate that the input-output relationship is "
"linear and the influence of noise is small."
msgstr ""
"また、測定の信頼性を確認するために**二乗コヒーレンス**（$\\gamma^2$、[物理モデル: コヒーレンス]"
"(../../explanation/physics_models.md) 参照）も計算します。$\\gamma^2$ が 1 "
"に近い周波数帯域は、入出力の関係が線形であり、ノイズの影響が少ないことを示します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:80002
#: 51b8f16266f346f08dcd2ec3b7d40dcd
msgid "3. Model Fitting"
msgstr "3\\. モデルフィッティング"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:80004
#: f0eeaeb350254996a494c757f5aab9ec
msgid ""
"We fit a theoretical model to the obtained transfer function (especially "
"around the resonance). Here, we define a transfer function model for a "
"harmonic oscillator and use least-squares fitting to determine the "
"parameters ($A, f_0, Q$)."
msgstr ""
"得られた伝達関数（特に共振付近）に対して、理論モデルをフィッティングします。 "
"ここでは、単振動の伝達関数モデルを定義し、最小二乗法でパラメータ（$A, f_0, Q$）を求めます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:80007
#: c8aaba9b4f6d4fa8af5baca3802a7d97
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Model equation (including gain $A$): $$ H(f) = A \\cdot "
"\\frac{f_0^2}{f_0^2 - f^2 + i (f f_0 / Q)} $$"
msgstr ""
"モデル式（ゲイン $A$ を含む）： $$ H(f) = A \\cdot \\frac{f_0^2}{f_0^2 - f^2 + i (f "
"f_0 / Q)} $$"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:100002
#: 66edb7dd05a648e5bcb72a3783cb99b4
msgid "4. Verification of Results"
msgstr "4\\. 結果の確認"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_transfer_function.ipynb:100004
#: fd303dd8cdff4bedbf4a3da577b4d264
msgid ""
"We verify the fitting results numerically and plot them overlaid on the "
"measured data. The `FitResult.plot()` method automatically generates a "
"Bode plot (magnitude and phase) for complex data."
msgstr ""
"フィッティング結果を数値で確認し、測定データに重ねてプロットします。 `FitResult.plot()` "
"メソッドは、複素数データの場合、自動的にボード線図（振幅・位相）を描画します。"

